 Li  6.941   Li.pz-gth-q1.UPF
 O   16.000  O.pz-gth-q6.UPF
ATOMIC_POSITIONS {crystal}
 Fe  0.5000000   0.5000000   0.5000000
 Li  0.0000000   0.0000000   0.0000000
 O   0.2404000   0.2404000   0.2404000
 O   0.7596000   0.7596000   0.7596000
K_POINTS {automatic}
 4 4 4 0 0 0
HUBBARD {ortho-atomic}
U Fe-3d 1.d-8
